    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectLight? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveObjectToBrightArea\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO DoSpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
